# Build output. The binary is derived from src/ and compile_csv2.zsh; keeping it
# in git would put a 5 MB blob in every clone for something a build reproduces
# in seconds.
# 建置產物。執行檔可由 src/ 與 compile_csv2.zsh 重現，放進 git 只會讓每個 clone
# 多帶一個 5 MB 的 blob，換取幾秒鐘的建置。
release/

# Index sidecars are derived from the data file, never the source of truth.
# 索引 sidecar 是從資料檔衍生出來的，永遠不是真實來源。
*.csv.index
*.csv2.index

# Test output and the temp dirs the suite creates beside itself.
# 測試輸出，以及測試腳本在自己旁邊建立的暫存目錄。
test/*.log
test/.test_csv2.*

# The measurement script's temp dirs. Its OUTPUT (measure_output*.txt) is
# committed on purpose: a measurement nobody can compare against a later one is
# not worth taking.
# 量測腳本的暫存目錄。它的「輸出」（measure_output*.txt）是刻意提交的：一次無法與
# 日後的執行相比的量測，不值得做。
verifications/.measure.*
src/BuildInfo.swift
